Absent -> {"mode":"explicitRequestOnly"} (role - developer)
<multi_agent_mode>Spawn sub-agents on your own when part of the work can run in parallel with yours or can be handed off without blocking your next step; the user does not need to ask. Keep work local when briefing a sub-agent would take longer than doing it.</multi_agent_mode>

